# PMS Sentinel is pre-launch. Every response tells crawlers to stay away, on
# every hostname (custom domain, *.pages.dev alias, and per-deployment hash
# URLs — each of those is a permanent public copy of whatever was built that
# day). Pair with public/robots.txt and Cloudflare Access; see README.
#
# Remove this block at public launch, not before.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
